                  <strong>Usage:</strong> Use variables in your prompts with the syntax <code style={{ background: "rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1)", padding: "0.125rem 0.25rem", borderRadius: "4px", fontSize: "0.8125rem" }}>{"${variable_name}"}</code>
